  "description": "Subject: Detection Summary \u2013 Version\u202f1.0.0  \n\nDuring the latest monitoring interval, which spans a period of\u202f60\u202fseconds across\u202f3\u202fsystems, two detection records were logged.  \n\nThe first record (ID\u202fdet001, sequence\u202f1) was captured at Unix time\u202f1700000000 and reported a communication status of **OK**. It contains data from two sensors:\u202fsensorA is located at position\u202f10, measured a volume of\u202f120, recorded an occupancy count of\u202f5 and a green\u2011light count of\u202f1; sensorB sits at position\u202f15, with a volume of\u202f85, occupancy\u202f3 and green count\u202f0.  \n\nThe second record (ID\u202fdet002, sequence\u202f2) was captured at Unix time\u202f1700000600 and reported a communication status of **FAIL**. This entry includes a single sensor,\u202fsensorC, positioned at\u202f20, registering a volume of\u202f200, occupancy\u202f8 and green count\u202f2."
